      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The purpose of subsection (1) is to permit certain substances that\nare covered by the TINDAPS Convention, or drug analogues of\nsuch substances, to be treated as controlled drugs for the purposes\nof this Part (see also section 300.1).\nNote:\nFor the meaning of drug analogue, see section 301.9.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The purpose of subsection (1) is to permit certain substances that\nare covered by the TINDAPS Convention, or drug analogues of\nsuch substances, to be treated as controlled drugs for the purposes\nof this Part (see also section 300.1).\nNote:\nFor the meaning of drug analogue, see section 301.9.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-2-norm"
