      "skos:note": "Defines trafficable quantity of controlled drug or plant"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012#sch-1-sec-301-18",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "301 12  Meaning of trafficable quantity",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "For the purposes of this Part, a trafficable quantity of a controlled\ndrug or a controlled plant is a quantity not less than that provided\nby the following table:\n\nTrafficable quantities of controlled drugs and plants\nItem\nControlled drug or\nplant\nTrafficable quantity (minimum)\nA controlled drug\n(other than a drug\nanalogue) or a\ncontrolled plant\nEither:\n(a) the quantity listed as a trafficable quantity of\nthe drug or plant in a regulation made for the\npurposes of this section; or\n(b) the quantity determined as a trafficable\nquantity of the drug or plant by the Minister\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSchedule 1  Serious drugs"
    },
