    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "301 17  Emergency determinations—publication",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012#sch-1-sec-301-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister must, on or before the day on which a determination\nunder this Subdivision is registered (within the meaning of the\nLegislative Instruments Act 2003):\n\n(a) make a public announcement of the determination; and\n\n(b) cause a copy of the announcement to be published:\n\n(i) on the internet; and\n\n(ii) in a newspaper circulating in each State, the Australian\nCapital Territory and the Northern Territory.\n\n(2) An announcement made under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSerious drugs  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012\nNo. 167, 2012            17",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister must, on or before the day on which a determination\nunder this Subdivision is registered (within the meaning of the\nLegislative Instruments Act 2003):\n\n(a) make a public announcement of the determination; and\n\n(b) cause a copy of the announcement to be published:\n\n(i) on the internet; and\n\n(ii) in a newspaper circulating in each State, the Australian\nCapital Territory and the Northern Territory.\n\n(2) An announcement made under subsection (1) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSerious drugs  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012\nNo. 167, 2012            17",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-1-sec-301-23-ss-1"
