      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the constable is not in uniform, the constable must give the\nsuspect any of the following information if requested by the\nsuspect:\n\n(a) the constable’s name;\n\n(b) the address of the constable’s place of duty;\n\n(c) the constable’s identification number (if any);\n\n(d) if the constable has no identification number—the\nconstable’s rank.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the constable is not in uniform, the constable must give the\nsuspect any of the following information if requested by the\nsuspect:\n\n(a) the constable’s name;\n\n(b) the address of the constable’s place of duty;\n\n(c) the constable’s identification number (if any);\n\n(d) if the constable has no identification number—the\nconstable’s rank.",
