    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "376 1  Definitions for Division 376",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012#sch-2-sec-376"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "In this Division:\nair passenger ticket, for a flight, means a ticket, or electronic\nrecord, on the basis of which a person is treated as being entitled to\ntravel as a passenger on:\n\n(a) the flight; or\n\n(b) a journey that includes the flight.\nfalse: identification information relating to a person is false if it is\nfalse in a material particular that affects the capacity of the\ninformation to be used (whether alone or in conjunction with other\ninformation or documents) to identify the person.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of identification information, see section 370.1.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nIdentity crime and air travel  Schedule 2\nFalse identity and air travel  Part 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012\nNo. 167, 2012            27",
      "skos:definition": "In this Division:\nair passenger ticket, for a flight, means a ticket, or electronic\nrecord, on the basis of which a person is treated as being entitled to\ntravel as a passenger on:\n\n(a) the flight; or\n\n(b) a journey that includes the flight.\nfalse: identification information relating to a person is false if it is\nfalse in a material particular that affects the capacity of the\ninformation to be used (whether alone or in conjunction with other\ninformation or documents) to identify the person.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of identification information, see section 370.1.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nIdentity crime and air travel  Schedule 2\nFalse identity and air travel  Part 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012\nNo. 167, 2012            27",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "613c3cb5cd4275a85eeb005cc7b4ade6632c751f9cdd68de060b801672d5b398",
      "skos:note": "Definition of air passenger ticket and false identification information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012#sch-2-sec-376",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "376 1  Definitions for Division 376",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "In this Division:\nair passenger ticket, for a flight, means a ticket, or electronic\nrecord, on the basis of which a person is treated as being entitled to\ntravel as a passenger on:\n\n(a) the flight; or\n\n(b) a journey that includes the flight.\nfalse: identification information relating to a person is false if it is\nfalse in a material particular that affects the capacity of the\ninformation to be used (whether alone or in conjunction with other\ninformation or documents) to identify the person.\nNote:\nFor the meaning of identification information, see section 370.1.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nIdentity crime and air travel  Schedule 2\nFalse identity and air travel  Part 2\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious Drugs, Identity Crime and Other Measures) Act 2012\nNo. 167, 2012            27"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
