    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "376 3  False identification information—air passenger tickets",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012#sch-2-sec-376-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "obtained using a carriage service\nCarriage service offence—using information to obtain an air\npassenger ticket\n\n(1) A person (the defendant) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the defendant uses information; and\n\n(b) the defendant does so:\n\n(i) with the result that an air passenger ticket for a flight is\nobtained (whether by the defendant or another person);\nand\n\n(ii) reckless as to whether the information is used to identify\nthe defendant, or another person, as a passenger on the\nflight; and\n\n(c) the information is identification information; and\n\n(d) the information is false in relation to the person who takes, or\nintends to take, the flight using the ticket; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSchedule 2  Identity crime and air travel",
      "skos:definition": "obtained using a carriage service\nCarriage service offence—using information to obtain an air\npassenger ticket\n\n(1) A person (the defendant) commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the defendant uses information; and\n\n(b) the defendant does so:\n\n(i) with the result that an air passenger ticket for a flight is\nobtained (whether by the defendant or another person);\nand\n\n(ii) reckless as to whether the information is used to identify\nthe defendant, or another person, as a passenger on the\nflight; and\n\n(c) the information is identification information; and\n\n(d) the information is false in relation to the person who takes, or\nintends to take, the flight using the ticket; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSchedule 2  Identity crime and air travel",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-376-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
