      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nconstitutional flight means:\n\n(a) a flight that starts or ends in a Territory; or\n\n(b) a flight between Australia and a foreign country in which an\naircraft is used in the course of trade or commerce, for the\ncarriage of passengers; or\n\n(c) a flight between one State and another State in which an\naircraft is used in the course of trade or commerce, for the\ncarriage of passengers.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section:\nconstitutional flight means:\n\n(a) a flight that starts or ends in a Territory; or\n\n(b) a flight between Australia and a foreign country in which an\naircraft is used in the course of trade or commerce, for the\ncarriage of passengers; or\n\n(c) a flight between one State and another State in which an\naircraft is used in the course of trade or commerce, for the\ncarriage of passengers.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-2-sec-30-norm"
