      "values:originalText": "Subsection 156(3) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006, as in force after the commencement of this item, applies in\nrelation to corrupt conduct engaged in before, on or after that\ncommencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSchedule 3  Other measures",
      "skos:definition": "Subsection 156(3) of the Law Enforcement Integrity Commissioner Act\n2006, as in force after the commencement of this item, applies in\nrelation to corrupt conduct engaged in before, on or after that\ncommencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012A00167\n\nSchedule 3  Other measures",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-drugs-identity-crime-and-other-measures-act-2012-sch-3-sec-6-norm"
        }
      ],
